<title>POLAND: UNIVERSAL TURNS TO PLN 25,200 LOSS IN NOV.</title>
<headline>UNIVERSAL TURNS TO PLN 25,200 LOSS IN NOV.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results November</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net loss		 0.03 vs   2.12 profit</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   0.04 vs   2.16 profit</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.17 vs   0.51</p>
<p> Sales		    6.30 vs   8.32</p>
<p>JANUARY-NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	    17.19 vs  12.23</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	22.30 vs  12.27</p>
<p> Operating profit     7.31 vs   3.81 loss</p>
<p> Sales		  101.23 vs 100.53</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish trading company is Universal SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
